      "section_digest": "f42507e9b25f65aee14170cfe7d9618875a82121da6ec6a49c40029e03ec5430"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-F-015-EXIT",
      "source": "GLOSSARY.md",
      "locator": "bold",
      "section": "T-F-015",
      "anchor": "- 定义：解释器与工件校验的退出码语义",
      "kind": "judgmental",
      "why": "",
      "quote": "- 定义：解释器与工件校验的退出码语义：`0` 全部通过；`1` 存在违规（含配置漂移 `config_drift`）；`2` 输入或配置非法（含 `config_invalid`/`config_incomplete`）；`3` 存在无法机械判定项（`cannot_evaluate`，含判定性配置缺失）；`4` 解释器不可用（如引用了未注册的检查或工件契约缺失）。多结论聚合优先级为 `4 > 2 > 3 > 1 > 0`：输入非法优先于不可判定，不可判定优先于显式违规，避免“判不了”被“已发现的违规”掩盖。",
      "section_digest": "5380d24454243dc124c57599ed8231428f65de7f5c67bac8bfe11e05177fbc41"
    },
    {
      "id": "CFG-01-JUDGE",
      "source": "contracts/schema/runtime-config.schema.json",
      "locator": "pointer",
      "section": "/properties/config/properties/CFG-01/description",
      "anchor": "",
      "kind": "judgmental",
      "why": "",
      "quote": "偏差按哪些对象维度分档。至少 1 项，取值必须来自封闭枚举。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3），不取默认。",
      "section_digest": "de211c65fb8f38fd48e64f612fca0f1412d958bc750cefc55acc078bee5b879e"
    },
    {
      "id": "CFG-03-JUDGE",
      "source": "contracts/schema/runtime-config.schema.json",
      "locator": "pointer",
      "section": "/properties/config/properties/CFG-03/description",
      "anchor": "",
      "kind": "judgmental",
      "why": "",
      "quote": "分档边界须升序、无重叠、覆盖声明区间，并写明偏差点定义（SPI / CPI / 自定义）。形状与枚举由本 schema 校验；升序与覆盖性由配置解释器在求值时判定（本批不实现）。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
      "section_digest": "418604ec72368e690a903935696d81b3b6bf46b6ea2cf749c84da89b44ca9fed"
    },
    {
      "id": "CFG-04-JUDGE",
      "source": "contracts/schema/runtime-config.schema.json",
      "locator": "pointer",
      "section": "/properties/config/properties/CFG-04/description",
      "anchor": "",
      "kind": "judgmental",
      "why": "",
      "quote": "状态按里程碑周期分数、自然日、周、月或小时采样。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。口径决定 CFG-05/CFG-06 或 CFG-07 的必填性，约束见顶层 allOf。",
      "section_digest": "21a01dc532a880b633af68e3292cfec1e607cc75d8d6ec7a0a906a09f03e7e34"
    },
    {
      "id": "CFG-06-EXPLICIT",
      "source": "contracts/schema/runtime-config.schema.json",
      "locator": "pointer",
      "section": "/properties/config/properties/CFG-06/description",
      "anchor": "",
      "kind": "judgmental",
      "why": "",
      "quote": "决定 1/3 的分母是 5（工作日）还是 7（自然日）。必须显式，不得由实现猜。仅当 CFG-04=milestone_fraction 时必填，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
      "section_digest": "47b1a1cc7e297aaca5ecc69d2be7a71909e70ea1f5286a791fe3ce28095d4a20"
